            <div xml:id="d830">

                <pb facs="0719" n="709" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg709"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 Strong, Robert C.: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Strong</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canton</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-26T20:00:00+08:00">August 26, 1949—8
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 26—4:07 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cantel 1027. ReCantel 1014, August 23 [<hi rendition="#italic">24</hi>].<anchor
                        n="74" xml:id="d830-f1"/> Clark departed this afternoon. I assumed charge as
                    of cob<anchor n="75" xml:id="d830-f2"/> August 25.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Strong</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
